 moment he lays there as  kaido goes to attack  zorro and free prometheus so the homie  can go and help big mom  lost switch places with zorro and hits  kaido with an injection  shot making him cough up blood law also  gets the compliment from kaido when he  says that law's abilities really throw  him off  and i enjoy how much the strongest  creature in the world is complimenting  our guys throughout this fight i still  find it crazy that we've gotten to the  point where characters are seriously  giving to yonko  trouble in a prolonged fight zoro being  the legend he is even tells law he  shouldn't have saved him because now the  flame thing  is going to save big mom the dude would  gladly have risked death to accomplish  the goal but law is not down with anyone  of the supernova dying which you gotta  appreciate the bromance is strong with  these two  and even kid is cool with the decision  saying that they just needed to split  them up  and kid and killer go take on big mom  i'm excited to see what these two might  accomplish against her moving forward we  then get big mom praising prometheus and  cursing zeus  prometheus asks for a favor and kit and  killer notice something strange about  the clouds let me know what you guys are  expecting here  what's prometheus got in mind we jump  back to unconscious luffy who  is again glaring at kaido kaido is  contemplating the ways he'll kill luffy  when zorro once again steps up for his  captain  he tells law he's reached his limit and  he can only launch one more attack he  says if it doesn't work and he ends up  dead it's up to lob  man zoro is just so badass  chapter after chapter willing to lay it  all on the line at any point i really  respect the dude he tells kaido that  luffy is his captain  and the yonko should take his head  before he gets ahead of himself  i'm so glad zoro was part of the yonko  fight here i cannot describe  how glad in words oda really delivered  with the epic zorro moments during this  battle  zorro uses post time skip 9 sword style  asura farce of the dead  it's epic it's hype but it doesn't bring  kaido down  nevertheless kaido is shocked suggesting  that zorro  has conquers hockey too which people  have been hoping for  for so long zoro doesn't know what he  means but we know how epic this  is and if he does in fact have it he  joins such a top  tier epic group of individuals since  rayleigh and katakuri have it  i think it's very fitting for zoro to  have it as well even if he didn't knock  kaido down as he hoped  this builds the hype for how strong zoro  will continue to get in the future kairu  even compliments zaro saying that his  attack will leave a scar  and that should be enough for the  supernova and honestly leaving a scar on  the strongest creature in the world is a  pretty huge accomplishment that should  not be slept on  another person we know that did that was  odin and odin was epic af  kaido has to admit this generation is  such a pain  and those kinds of statements are always  music to my ears kaido hits zorro and  law with a lightning fast  thunder bhagwa kaido still considers it  a pity they didn't  join him since they could have taken  over the world together  and i get how he feels as a captain he's  always looking for talent  and these guys have it in boatloads  however luffy gets up and  unlike last time he's not even close to  being out of commission after losing  consciousness  he says no one would team up with an  idiot like kaido he promises to  send the strongest creature in the world  flying  this dude's got some serious serious  king energy already luffy recalls yogurt  teaching him about coating himself in  haki  and letting it flow from his fist he  also told him that in the middle of  danger  that power truly blooms and i love the  flower imagery there  and i love that idea that when pushed  into a corner  you can pull out more resources than you  ever thought you had  and see what you're truly capable of  luffy is about to surpass his limits  luffy points out that kaido uses  conquerors haki  to code himself and kaido says only a  handful of powerful individuals can do  it  and then this chapter that's already  been crazy good  gets even better just when kaido is sure  he'll finish off luffy  luffy uses conker's hockey himself and  we see what we  saw when whitebeard and the pirate king  clashed  not only the black streaks but also  these two are clashing without making  direct contact  law is amazed and luffy is doing  amazingly well  clearly having the upper hand right now  punching kaido around  obviously it won't be that easy and  kaido might have been caught off guard  but it's definitely not a coincidence  that oda is drawing parallels between  luffy versus kaido  and whitebeard vs roger luffy appears to  be on a whole  other level compared to the other  supernova right now and accordingly  he tells them to leave the rest to him  he wants them to head back down as he  confidently says  he's got this he's confident that  one-on-one  he can beat kaido and that's so hyped  since we got that quote before that in a  one-on-one fight  always bet on kaido and yet luffy's  mastery of conquerors haki  may actually let him back up his claim  as he continues to use it in creative  ways  it's so funny because kid wanted to take  down kaido but he went after big mom  without a second thought  and now luffy is gonna go against kaido  by himself  the story is making it blatantly clear  in these ways that luffy is the one  he's the leader he's the future pirate  king i gotta admit i keep hoping that  zorro has an ace up his sleeve  and he'll open his closed eye and  everyone will just go crazy but  it's suggested that he did everything he  could do here and you honestly  can't be dissatisfied with zorro in this  battle he was legendary  however luffy is clearly number one and  as zoro says he's given it his all  luffy appears to be just getting started  and that is it for this  one let m